WEBVTT

00:00:07.181 --> 00:00:10.931
They said, “We need somebody

00:00:10.931 --> 00:00:15.000
Who can finally put things right”

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.910
They filled the room to hear the answer

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:22.739
I thought we’d start that night

00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:26.410
I said, “I don’t have every answer

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:30.000
I won’t tell you that I do

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.750
We’ll find out why it isn’t working

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.064
And I’ll do the work with you”

00:00:37.739 --> 00:00:41.649
You asked me for an answer

00:00:41.649 --> 00:00:45.559
I told you what it takes

00:00:45.559 --> 00:00:49.388
You asked if there was some way

00:00:49.388 --> 00:00:52.739
You wouldn’t have to change

00:00:52.739 --> 00:00:56.569
You wanted me to change the world

00:00:56.569 --> 00:01:00.399
But leave your world alone

00:01:00.399 --> 00:01:04.468
I came here to work beside you

00:01:04.468 --> 00:01:06.064
Not to do it on my own

00:01:12.926 --> 00:01:16.516
They’d heard a thousand easy answers

00:01:16.516 --> 00:01:20.585
“You won’t have to change a thing

00:01:20.585 --> 00:01:24.654
Keep on living like you’re living

00:01:24.654 --> 00:01:28.165
Leave the rest of it to me”

00:01:28.165 --> 00:01:32.074
I said, “We have to work together”

00:01:32.074 --> 00:01:35.824
They said, “Then what are you here for?”

00:01:35.824 --> 00:01:39.814
They chose the promise that asked nothing

00:01:39.814 --> 00:01:41.569
And didn’t listen anymore

00:01:43.883 --> 00:01:46.277
I’m not asking for your last dollar

00:01:46.277 --> 00:01:48.351
Or the strength you haven’t got

00:01:48.351 --> 00:01:50.106
Some can give a little

00:01:50.106 --> 00:01:52.021
Some can give a lot

00:01:52.021 --> 00:01:53.936
I can help us find the answers

00:01:53.936 --> 00:01:56.250
But that’s not where the work is done

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.245
Knowing how to make it better

00:01:58.245 --> 00:01:59.840
Doesn’t mean the change has come

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:04.149
You asked me for an answer

00:02:04.149 --> 00:02:07.979
I told you what it takes

00:02:07.979 --> 00:02:11.888
You asked if there was some way

00:02:11.888 --> 00:02:15.319
You wouldn’t have to change

00:02:15.319 --> 00:02:19.069
You wanted me to change the world

00:02:19.069 --> 00:02:22.899
But leave your world alone

00:02:22.899 --> 00:02:26.968
I came here to work beside you

00:02:26.968 --> 00:02:28.644
Not to do it on my own

00:02:28.723 --> 00:02:38.723
When the promises wore thin

00:02:39.096 --> 00:02:43.085
When the promises wore thin

00:02:43.085 --> 00:02:46.995
I heard the same old call:

00:02:46.995 --> 00:02:54.335
“Why won’t somebody do something?”

00:02:54.335 --> 00:02:59.771
Somebody else.
